.SH EXTENSIONS
In
.IR \%ncurses ","
.B \%mvcur
accepts
.B \-1
for either or both old coordinates.
This value tells
.I \%ncurses
that the old location is unknown,
and that it must use only absolute motion,
as with the
.B \%cursor_address
.RB ( cup )
capability,
rather than the least costly combination of absolute and relative
motion.
